OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 17 MAR
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GElizabeth Alker showcases the
OL,6,     Gbest performances from the UK and
OL,7,     Gbeyond, including the Gesualdo
OL,8,     GSix at the Portico of Ards
OL,9,     Gfestival and music from Richard
OL,10,     GStrauss's Intermezzo.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Donizetti
OL,12,     GDonald Macleod follows the
OL,13,     Girresistible rise of Italian
OL,14,     Gopera composer Gaetano Donizetti.
OL,15,     GToday, Donizetti battles
OL,16,     G"pirates", writes about love
OL,17,     Gpotions, and falls in love
OL,18,     Ghimself.
