OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GKatie Derham is joined live in
OL,6,     Gstudio by Gerard Flotats ahead of
OL,7,     Ghis concert at the Barnes Music
OL,8,     GFestival. Also, Greg James chats
OL,9,     Gto Katie about Radio 1's Longest
OL,10,     GRide.
OL,11,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,12,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,13,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,14,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,15,     GConductor Nil Venditti joins
OL,16,     GRoyal Northern Sinfonia and
OL,17,     Gviolinist Maria Wloszczowska at
OL,18,     Gthe Glasshouse in Gateshead to
OL,19,     Gperform music by Anna Clyne,
OL,20,     GProkofiev and Mendelssohn.
