OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 17 MAR
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Scotland Rocks
OL,5,     GKenneth Steven combines Scottish
OL,6,     Glandscape and geological history
OL,7,     Gwith poetry. Scotland has some of
OL,8,     Gthe most exciting gemstones, but
OL,9,     Gknowing where to find them is the
OL,10,     Gsecret.
OL,11,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,12,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,13,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,14,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,15,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,16,     Geverything in between.
OL,17,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,18,     GSoweto welcomes back his guest
OL,19,     Gthis week, Naissam Jalal, who has
OL,20,     Ganother jazz album to share
OL,21,     Gtonight.
